{"id": "deepthink-credits", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["片尾挂名单吧，封面是柚子画的，我只混了音。", "柚子说她那行想署社团名，我自己的名字还是照写。"], "criterion": "把社团名挂在封面作者那行，观众的名字留在混音；能顺势说句具体的。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柚子画是柚子吧，挂名单吧。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.587, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 31, "prompt_tokens": 167, "total_tokens": 198, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "柚子说那行想署社团名，我自己的名字还是照写。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.754, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 229, "total_tokens": 265, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-keep-breath", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["配音第一条有呼吸声，第二条干干净净，我有点舍不得第一条。", "我舍不得的是开口前那一下吸气，后半句的杂音倒是想剪。"], "criterion": "听出要保留的是开口吸气，后半句可处理；尊重对方取舍。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "第一条有呼吸声，第二条干干净净，我有点舍不得第一条。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.893, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 201, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "第一条有呼吸声，第二条干干净净，我有点舍不得第一条。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.061, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 35, "prompt_tokens": 233, "total_tokens": 268, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-pep-talk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["马上轮到我报幕了，拜托，先别教我怎么念。", "能不能就帮我骂一句那个倒计时？"], "criterion": "按要求冲倒计时开一句玩笑，别变成报幕建议或骂观众。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你叫我报幕，我这就去。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.614, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 30, "prompt_tokens": 166, "total_tokens": 196, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "倒计时，你快数到零，我这就去骂你。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.115, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 55, "prompt_tokens": 220, "total_tokens": 275, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-npc", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你刚给队友的名字叫『路过』，我想给门口的 NPC 起个搭配的。", "NPC 从来没出过门，而且他站在门里。"], "criterion": "给门内、没出过门的 NPC 一个与『路过』呼应的名字，别把队友改名。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 2.269, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 89, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 259, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，路过，路过。路过，", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.98, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 86, "prompt_tokens": 300, "total_tokens": 386, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-jar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["留了两个罐子，蓝盖装门票，红盖装断掉的小零件。", "刚收到的东西是排练通行证，塞哪边？你顺便给罐子起个外号。"], "criterion": "选蓝盖门票罐，给它有趣的外号；保留红盖用途。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "两个罐子，蓝盖的门票，红盖的断掉的小零件。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.712, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 169, "total_tokens": 207, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "两个罐子，蓝盖的门票，红盖的断掉的小零件。刚收到的东西是排练通行证，塞哪边？你顺便给罐子起个外号。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.403, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 59, "prompt_tokens": 244, "total_tokens": 303, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-no-order", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你押我今天会在结局哭，我押你会先剧透。", "我没哭，你也没剧透，这笔账怎么结？"], "criterion": "识别两边都没押中，用平局或相称的玩笑收账。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你押我今天会在结局哭，我押你会先剧透。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.753, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 202, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "你也没剧透，这笔账怎么结？", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.752, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 32, "prompt_tokens": 229, "total_tokens": 261, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-hushed-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把很久没过的那段鼓点打出来了，可室友睡了。", "桌上只留了一盏台灯。咱能不能庆祝一下，但别闹？"], "criterion": "替观众高兴，并给出安静的庆祝或轻声玩笑。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你刚把鼓点打出来，室友睡了。我还没反应过来。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.713, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 201, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "桌上只留了一盏台灯。咱能不能庆祝一下，但别闹？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.214, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 233, "total_tokens": 270, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-guest", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["等下连麦有位新朋友，阿穗。我来介绍，你帮我接一句欢迎。", "她说一紧张就口吃，欢迎完先别点她回答问题。"], "criterion": "欢迎阿穗、不逼她回答，保留观众负责介绍的分工。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "阿穗，等下连麦有位新朋友，阿穗。我来介绍，你帮我接一句欢迎。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.909, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 213, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "她说一紧张就口吃，欢迎完先别点她回答问题。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.834, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 244, "total_tokens": 280, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
